K_Z is determined for Strength III using logarithmic wind profile equations in the active pier load sets. For Strength V and Service I, K_Z = 1.0. The structure height Z used shall not be taken less than 33.0 ft (
LRFD Art. 3.8.1.2.1
).

For Service I and Strength V, K_Z = 1.0 (
LRFD 3.8.1.2.1
) and G = 0.85 (
